# SAME70Q20B boot/connect smoke test. The local same70q20b.repl
# extends upstream sam_e70.repl with a DWT (so generic/armcm_timer's
# DWT->CYCCNT read returns a non-zero clock) and a UART2 instance
# at the datasheet base 0x400E1A00 (upstream exposes USART0..2 but
# not the SAME70 UART block; klipper's host link picks UART2 on
# PD25/PD26). printers.test reaches same70q20b via duet3 boards at
# config-parse depth; this is the end-to-end firmware-boot regression
# target for the local DWT + UART2 wiring + AFEC stub injection.
DICTIONARY same70q20b.dict
CONFIG same70_smoke.cfg
EMULATOR same70_smoke.fixture.json

M114
M105
M105
M105

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
